  </section>

  <!-- About Story Section -->
  <section class="about section" id="about">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-grid">
        <div class="about-image reveal-left">
          <img src="/images/lookbook/model-4.jpeg" alt="Jewels by Iram craftsmanship" loading="lazy">
          <div class="about-image-accent"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="about-content reveal-right">
          <span class="section-label">Our Story</span>
          <h2 class="section-title">Crafting Timeless<br>Elegance</h2>
          <div class="gold-divider"></div>
          <p>Jewels by Iram is a luxury anti-tarnish jewelry brand based in the UAE. We believe that every woman deserves to adorn herself with jewelry that is not only beautiful but also enduring. Our collection is carefully curated to bring you the finest pieces that maintain their shine and elegance over time.</p>
          <p>Each piece in our collection is crafted with premium anti-tarnish materials, ensuring that your jewelry looks as stunning as the day you first wore it. From delicate nose pins to statement waist chains, our diverse range caters to every style and occasion.</p>
          <div class="about-stats">
            <div class="stat">
              <span class="stat-number">100+</span>
              <span class="stat-label">Unique Designs</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stat">
              <span class="stat-number">500+</span>
              <span class="stat-label">Happy Clients</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stat">
              <span class="stat-number">5+</span>
              <span class="stat-label">Years of Craft</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section about-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-values reveal-up">
        <div class="value-card">
          <i class="fas fa-gem"></i>
          <h3>Premium Quality</h3>
          <p>We use only the finest anti-tarnish materials to ensure lasting beauty and durability in every piece we create.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-card">
          <i class="fas fa-heart"></i>
          <h3>Crafted with Love</h3>
          <p>Every jewelry piece is designed and crafted with attention to detail, reflecting our passion for beauty and elegance.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-card">
          <i class="fas fa-users"></i>
          <h3>Customer First</h3>
          <p>We are committed to providing exceptional service, from personalized assistance to reliable delivery across the UAE.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-card">
          <i class="fas fa-leaf"></i>
          <h3>Sustainable Beauty</h3>
          <p>Our anti-tarnish jewelry is designed to last, reducing the need for frequent replacements and promoting sustainable fashion.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="about-categories reveal-up">
        <h2>What We Offer</h2>
        <p class="text-center">We specialize in a wide range of anti-tarnish jewelry categories:</p>
        <div class="category-tags">
          <span class="tag">Bracelets</span>
          <span class="tag">Bangles</span>
          <span class="tag">Rings</span>
          <span class="tag">Necklaces</span>
          <span class="tag">Earrings</span>
          <span class="tag">Anklets</span>
          <span class="tag">Nose Pins</span>
          <span class="tag">Waist Chains</span>
          <span class="tag">Gift Hampers</span>
        </div>
      </div>

