        <h2>Connect With Us</h2>
        <p>We are always happy to assist you. Whether you're looking for a specific piece or need help with a wholesale order, don't hesitate to reach out.</p>
        <div class="cta-buttons">
          <a href="https://wa.me/971567241398?text=Hi%2C%20I%27m%20interested%20in%20your%20jewelry!" class="btn btn-whatsapp" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <i class="fab fa-whatsapp"></i> Chat on WhatsApp
          </a>
          <a href="/shop" class="btn btn-gold">View Collections</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

